      "created_at": "2021-03-15T04:08:46.162Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A little sad we do not have Zombie minions/lieutenants in the main book.<br>\nI will probably use the homunculus for  the tougher ones but not sure if the weaker ones should also just get bonus to saves or bonus to Hinder based on group size as they swarm and overbear.<br>\nAny suggestions?<br>\nAlso the season 1 livestream and “Stolen Legacy” had lieutenants with a resurrect ability but such an ability is not in the main book was it too over powered? I know The Visitors hated the Imp-possum.<br>\nWould a die upgrade / heal ability be too over powered for a minion or lieutenant</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-03-15T04:08:46.162Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 1,
