      "username": "degausser",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/9fc29f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2021-03-27T01:53:57.811Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For Zombies I made them a d8 minion with +1 to damage saves.  If you wanted to do a zombie horde that is easily killable, I’d suggest a d6 minion with a special +1 to hinder targets if another zombie is present in the scene (maximum +4)</p>\n<p>There are a lot of ways to build out minions in the Bullpen section and a lot of suggestions for unique extras they can have.  I’d suggest perusing through that chapter and maybe that’ll stir the creative juices.</p>",
