      "created_at": "2021-03-27T21:56:59.170Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Alternatively or in addition to <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/cult_of_gloom\">@Cult_of_Gloom</a>’s suggested way of using a zombie horde Lieutenant, a zombie Lieutenant could merely represent a single particularly tough zombie, of course.</p>\n<p>I suggest giving zombie horde Lieutenants offensive Abilities, though, to make up for the fact that they are only a single die each, however.</p>",
